      "created_at": "2016-03-09T01:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm playing Fanatic and Ra against Kismet. Ra is using Drawn to the Flame to do massive damage to everything, and has flipped the Talisman to the \"Stolen Charm\" side. I want Fanatic to play Chastise (\"play next to a non-hero target other than a character card\") on the Talisman, but the video game isn't letting me do so. It's certainly letting me damage with it Drawn to the Flame, so I'm pretty sure that the Talisman should be a legal target for Chastise.</p><p>Is this a bug or am I misinterpreting the rules?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:55.155Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
